### GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=IntelliJ IDEA



### ==========================================
### 1. BRUGERE
### ==========================================

### Opret bruger
POST http://localhost:7070/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testbruger",
  "password": "TestPassword123!",
  "email": "testbruger@example.com"
}

###

### Opret bruger2
POST http://localhost:7070/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testbruger2",
  "password": "TestPassword123!",
  "email": "testbruger2@example.com"
}




### Log ind
POST http://localhost:7070/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testbruger",
  "password": "TestPassword123!"
}

###

### Log ud
POST http://localhost:7070/users/logout

###

### Hent nuværende bruger
GET http://localhost:7070/users/me


### ==========================================
### 2. SPILVALG
### ==========================================

### Hent tilgængelige spilnavne
GET http://localhost:7070/game-selection/names

###

### Hent spilleplader for spilnavn med ID 1
GET http://localhost:7070/game-selection/boards?gameNameId=1


### ==========================================
### 3. OPRET SPIL
### ==========================================

### Opret spil for den indloggede bruger
### Forudsætter, at brugeren er logget ind,
### og at session-cookien bevares.
POST http://localhost:7070/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gameBoardId": 1,
  "players": [
    {
      "name": "Spiller 1",
      "age": 12
    },
    {
      "name": "Spiller 2",
      "age": 25
    }
  ]
}


### ==========================================
### 4. HENT SPIL
### ==========================================

### Hent spil med ID 1
GET http://localhost:7070/games/1


### ==========================================
### 5. SPILTURE
### ==========================================

### Udfør spillets tur
POST http://localhost:7070/games/1/turn


### ==========================================
### 6. ABEUDFORDRING
### ==========================================

### Afslut abeudfordring
POST http://localhost:7070/games/1/monkey-challenge/complete


### ==========================================
### 7. KORT-HANDLING
### ==========================================

### Afslut kort-handling
POST http://localhost:7070/games/1/card-action/complete


### ==========================================
### 8. SPILLERSTATUS
### ==========================================

### Markér bruger 1 som en spiller, der har spillet
POST http://localhost:7070/games/1/users/1/played

###

### Kontrollér, om bruger 1 har spillet før
GET http://localhost:7070/games/1/users/1/played


### ==========================================
### 9. TERNING
### ==========================================

### Kast terning
POST http://localhost:7070/dice/roll


### ==========================================
### 10. MØNT
### ==========================================

### Slå plat eller krone
POST http://localhost:7070/coin/flip